%description:
TR 38.901 Table 7.4.1-1 gives its rural macrocell path loss for "5m <= W <= 50m". A street
width of 4 m is outside it. The first evaluation of a link of the cell is an error, unless
tolerateHeightViolation is set.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

# a rural macrocell (TR 38.901 RMa), whose path loss takes the building height and street width
*.gnb.scenario = "RURAL_MACROCELL"
*.gnb.streetWidth = 4m

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
the cell's building height is 5 m and its street width 4 m (the buildingHeight and streetWidth of its base station node), outside the range TR 38.901 Table 7.4.1-1 gives for the scenario RURAL_MACROCELL (5 m <= h <= 50 m, 5 m <= W <= 50 m)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
